# ============================================================
# Git hygiene (2026-06-03) — CI key foot-guns & committed junk
# Prevent accidental re-commit of service-account keys, local
# databases, and stray deploy test files.
# ============================================================
*key*.json
gha-key.json
*.db
deploy/TEST*.txt

